The assertion of the lemma is equivalent to  egin{align}  inom{2j+1}{i}-\delta_{2j+1,i}=\sum_{k=1}^nl_{i,k}u_{k,j}, \end{align} for all $i,j$ such that $0 \leq i,j \leq n$. For $i \geq 2j+1$, both sides of \eqref{eqn:binom2} are evidently equal to zero. If $i=0$, then, since $l_{0,k}=\delta_{0,k}$, both sides of \eqref{eqn:binom2} are equal to $1$. It remains to prove \eqref{eqn:binom2} for $i,j$ such that $0<i<2j+1 \leq n$, i.e.  egin{align}  inom{2j+1}{i}-\delta_{2j+1,i}&=\sum_{k=1}^n inom{k}{i-k} inom{2j-k}{k-1} rac{2j+1}{k} 
otag\ &=\sum_{k=1}^i inom{k}{i-k} inom{2j-k}{k-1} rac{2j+1}{k}. \end{align} Note that $ inom{k}{i-k}$ vanishes for $k > i$. We now rewrite the right hand side of \eqref{eqn:binom3} as  egin{align} \sum_{k=1}^i inom{k}{i-k} inom{2j-k}{k-1} rac{2j+1}{k}&=\sum_{k=1}^i inom{k}{i-k} inom{2j+1-k}{k} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-k} 
otag \ &=\sum_{k=0}^i inom{2j+1-k}{i-k} inom{2j+1-i}{2k-i} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-k} 
otag \ &=\sum_{k=0}^i inom{2j+1-k}{2j+1-i} inom{2j+1-i}{2j-2k+1} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-k} 
otag \ &=\sum_{k=0}^i inom{2j-k}{2j-i} inom{2j+1-i}{2j-2k+1} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-i} 
otag \ &=\sum_{k=0}^i inom{2j-k}{i-k} inom{2j+1-i}{2j-2k+1} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-i} 
otag \ &=\sum_{k=0}^i inom{2j-i+k}{k} inom{2j+1-i}{2j-2i+2k+1} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-i}, \end{align} and apply Lemma ef{lem:app} to conclude the proof.

We now rewrite the right hand side of \eqref{eqn:binom3} as  egin{align} \sum_{k=1}^i inom{k}{i-k} inom{2j-k}{k-1} rac{2j+1}{k}&=\sum_{k=1}^i inom{k}{i-k} inom{2j+1-k}{k} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-k} 
otag \ &=\sum_{k=0}^i inom{2j+1-k}{i-k} inom{2j+1-i}{2k-i} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-k} 
otag \ &=\sum_{k=0}^i inom{2j+1-k}{2j+1-i} inom{2j+1-i}{2j-2k+1} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-k} 
otag \ &=\sum_{k=0}^i inom{2j-k}{2j-i} inom{2j+1-i}{2j-2k+1} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-i} 
otag \ &=\sum_{k=0}^i inom{2j-k}{i-k} inom{2j+1-i}{2j-2k+1} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-i} 
otag \ &=\sum_{k=0}^i inom{2j-i+k}{k} inom{2j+1-i}{2j-2i+2k+1} rac{2j+1}{2j+1-i}, \end{align} and apply Lemma ef{lem:app} to conclude the proof.

